description: Java 25 language features and virtual-thread guidance for Spring Boot 4 code — records, sealed types, pattern matching, scoped values, structured concurrency status. Use when choosing between records/sealed types/pattern matching, enabling or tuning virtual threads, replacing ThreadLocal with scoped values, or deciding whether a preview API is safe to use.
alwaysApply: false
